{
  "_comment": [
    "Inventory of every event code the core can actually emit, with provenance.",
    "",
    "Hand-maintained, because a grep cannot resolve the templated codes",
    "(`ach_transfer.${verb}`) without knowing each template's value set. Every",
    "entry cites the source line it comes from so a reviewer can check it, and",
    "scripts/build_crosswalk.py --check re-greps the source for LITERAL codes and",
    "reports any that are missing here, so drift in the easy half is caught",
    "automatically.",
    "",
    "This file is the denominator of the reachability view. Adding a code here",
    "that the core does not really emit inflates reachability and is exactly the",
    "kind of over-claim this artifact exists to prevent."
  ],
